// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Specialized root formerly in qwen36/legacy/sources/gfx1151/mul_mat_id/q4_k_f32/mul_mat_id_q4_k_f32_mmqt_pre_swiglu.loom
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Expert-stationary MMQ MUL_MAT_ID for Q4_K weights, RDNA3.5 (gfx1151).
//
// Activations are quantized to int8 once per (token, 32-value group) into LDS
// -- one thread per pair -- so the dot4 loop reads packed int8 from LDS
// instead of re-deriving the packing per row. Partial sums are loop-carried
// registers, never LDS.
//
// The loop nest is expert-stationary: workgroups(row_tiles, nexperts, 1), each
// owning one expert and a 16-row band, streaming that band once while
// accumulating against every token routed to the expert. No workgroup is
// speculative -- each finds its own matches -- unlike a (row, token, expert)
// grid where most blocks launch only to discover their expert is unused.
//
// 16 rows per workgroup, 256 threads: the main loop views them as 16 rows x
// 16 token-slot lanes with each lane walking 2 of the 32 staged tokens;
// the activation prepass views the same 256 threads as 32 tokens x 8 groups.


